<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A2.SS4" title="In Appendix B Additional Experimental Results ‣ Frequency-Modulated Visual Restoration for Matryoshka Large Multimodal Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">B.4 </span>Additional case results</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A2.SS5" title="In Appendix B Additional Experimental Results ‣ Frequency-Modulated Visual Restoration for Matryoshka Large Multimodal Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">B.5 </span>Baseline results of token numbers</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></nav>
